FIR No. 0021/2026 dated 08.01.2026, ACB Police Station, Lucknow
Sections: Prevention of Corruption Act 1988 s. 7 and 13(1)(d); IPC 120B
Complainant: Shri Ramakant Tripathi (contractor), mobile +91-9415-778899
It is alleged that Executive Engineer Sudhir Agarwal demanded Rs. 3,00,000 as bribe for clearing pending bills of Rs. 48 lakh. The demand was made on 04-01-2026 from his official mobile 9935001100 and confirmed through his PA Neeraj Saxena. The bribe amount was to be handed over near Gomti Nagar. A trap was laid on 07/01/2026 and Rs. 3,00,000 was recovered from Sudhir Agarwal's Scorpio UP 32 LK 1001.
Investigating Officer: DSP Mohit Chandra
